# Build context for map-web/Dockerfile, which builds from the repository root
# because map-web resolves @bcgov/epic-map through the root npm workspace.
#
# map-api has its own .dockerignore and is built with map-api/ as its context,
# so nothing here applies to it.

.git
.github

# Installed inside the image from the lockfile, never copied in.
**/node_modules
**/dist

# Secrets. sample.env is the committed template and is safe to keep.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/sample.env

# Nothing the web build needs.
map-api
deployment
**/venv
**/coverage
**/.pytest_cache
**/__pycache__
**/cypress
**/*.log
